{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113736132865249280"]}, "author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-10-23T20:57:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113736533023015217"], "id": "2113736533023015217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2719, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Inflation is Still the Problem\nRational Dissent Episode 014\n\nPost-COVID structural shifts like deglobalization and tariffs have permanently eliminated the cheap goods deflation that previously offset services inflation, leaving the U.S. settled in a 3% inflation world where a 5% https://t.co/f7F6MiTlb0", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2113736533023015217"}, {"author_id": "30034124", "created_at": "2026-10-23T20:32:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113730187367964924"], "id": "2113730187367964924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 335, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "As Fermilab builds components for its powerful new linear accelerator, engineers are driving innovation by using a collaborative robot to automate the assembly of superconducting cavities, sharply reducing the risk of errors in a cleanroom environment.\nhttps://t.co/sw0sOGL5G2", "url": "https://x.com/Fermilab/status/2113730187367964924"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113725916207579136"]}, "author_id": "3039504459", "created_at": "2026-10-23T20:15:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113725918711566830"], "id": "2113725918711566830", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 315, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "#OnTheCover of this week’s issue: Scanning tunneling microscope topographic image of a cluster-decorated Lieb lattice constructed with 57 Fe adatoms on a Ag(111) surface.\n\nCheck out the complete issue: https://t.co/PMcVWkBrvT https://t.co/fqN0AdZyL5", "url": "ht