 "quoted"}], "text": "Here is the essential primer on #China's national data dominance strategy - what it's been &amp; where they're going next:\nhttps://t.co/FA6IhCIAzu https://t.co/MNa6rxVxcM https://t.co/RH7GqU1Yn0", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2113648161533132953"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:05:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113647998773182478"], "id": "2113647998773182478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4623, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113639609938690237", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "“To me, this is much more than another tax crackdown. It illustrates a fundamental truth about wealth in China: no matter how much you accumulate, how carefully you structure it, or how far into the future you plan, no wealth is truly safe under CCP rule.” https://t.co/bxAgZuBwVY", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2113647998773182478"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113646645262925824"]}, "author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:00:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113646768873161043"], "id": "2113646768873161043", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 24069, "like_count": 151, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113626346467332264", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Learned some interesting details in this POLITICO story on @tysonbrody. But also I thought it missed a few important details, such as the fact that if you invite him over to your house, he will bring you a gigantic box of pandan-flavorted pastries https://t.co/UjMnloI3cF https://t.co/voKbZ4RpY5", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113646768873161043"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2113736132865249280", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2113725916207579136", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113698732084547584", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key":